   "fixPrompt": "Players of Reforge Front are reporting a bug on Steam. Find the cause in this codebase and fix it.\n\nBug: HP meter bug\nArea of the game: UI, controls, mechanics\nReported by 1 player (English), between 2025-07-04 and 2025-07-04.\n\nWhat the reports say about reproducing it:\n- HP meter was bugged at time of playing; unclear if still present or what the bug was.\n\nPlayer reports (translated to English):\n- Steam review (2025-07-04, 0.3 h played): \"HP meter had a bug. (from the post: i saw this on the dev's yt and gave it a go  PROS pretty good torbjorn simulator td game i rate it higher than pve in overwatch 3d is a nice change from usual bird eye view td format the pop gun and hammer feels smooth cute lil gobbos come to take ur forge  CONS needs option to turn off the recoil head bob effect at the time of playing hp meter was bugged i think if the pop gun had a close quarters secondary mode that would be nice switching to the hammer is too slow)\"\n  https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995186543/recommended/2807130/\n\nWork out the most likely cause from the code, fix it, and tell me what you changed and how to test it. If the reports aren't enough to pin it down, say what to ask the players.",
