   "notes": "Patch Notes:\n- Loading screen improvements\n- Bullets interact with grass\n- Enable v-sync by default\n- Make default sens higher\n- New bomb building\n- Make barricades price / 2\n- Bigger bomb goblin hit box\n- Reduce wait time from 30sec > 15sec\n- Variable jump heights\n- Many new SFX\n- BIG Color adjustments \n- Grass/ground changes \n- Saturation changes\n- Smarter goblin navigation\n- Cannon rotation bug fix\n- Add back unstuck\n- Game name change from \"Forge Front\" to \"Forg\" to make it easier to search for and more memorable.\n- Balance worlds \n- Balance goblin economy\n- Balance Furnace\n- Update steam page\n- Cannon rope model fix\n- tutorial changes\n- More credits\n- Tree improvements\n- Wind and water improvements\n- Fix bug reset buildings placed for each level\n\nRoadmap:\n- More SFX, music improvements \n- Balance\n- Feedback and suggestions from the community",
   "matched": [],
   "checked": true,
   "partly": []
  },
  {
   "gid": "509567431915603800",
   "name": "Forg QoL Update! + New Level",
   "version": null,
   "time": 1736092080,
   "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2807130/view/509567431915603800",
   "notes": "Patch Notes:\n\n-  Improved tutorial & tutorial prompts for better clarity.\n\n-  Building limit now shows max text instead of cost.\n\n-  Increased music volume by +5 dB.\n\n-  Added more tips \"IT'S OVER, GOBLINS. I HAVE THE HIGH GROUND!\" - CANNON\n\n-  Moved loading screen tips to the options tab due to faster load times.\n\n-  Replaced icons and symbols with emojis to fix alignment issues. 🪙❤️💥💣🌑☀️\n\n-  Made upgrade information easier to understand, add extra information as tips.\n\n-  Collect gold from chests.\n\n-  Eat mushrooms to heal.\n\n-  Corrected next item and previous item scroll order issues.\n\n-  Fixed scroll UI bugs.\n\n-  Resolved speed line overlay bugs and made improvements.\n\n-  Fixed damage overlay bugs and made improvements.\n\n-  Adjusted barricade model ropes.\n\n-  Added more shake effects for interactions.\n\n-  Achievements now available on more levels.\n\n-  Removed fruit basket.\n\n-  All levels baked.\n\n-  New OG Level Crystal, Very Hard+ Start with 100 gold (instead of 400) & No healing mushrooms and limited high ground for strategic placements. Big respect to you if you can beat Crystal on Night Mode.\n\n-  Fix place building flash.\n\n-  Add bomb place particles.\n\n-  Fix sky resources.\n\n-  Updated screenshots.\n\n-  Update GIFs.\n\n-  Updated trailer.\n\nRoadmap:\n\n-  Engine upgrade for better performance.\n\n-  Community feedback and suggestions.",
   "matched": [],
   "checked": true,
   "partly": []
  },
  {
   "gid": "690882175138005309",
   "name": "Reforge Front Update",
   "version": null,
   "time": 1777578540,
   "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2807130/view/690882175138005309",
   "notes": "New Features\n\n- \nController Support: Full support added with aim assist.\n\n- \nmacOS: Now officially playable on Mac.\n\n- \nWidescreen: UI and textures now scale correctly.\n\n- \nBlood Moon: New event! Snow and lava levels are now night-only.\n\nGameplay & Audio\n\n- \nSpeed: Switching equipment is now 33% faster.\n\n- \nComfort: Reduced headbob by 50%.\n\n- \nWaves: Press Q to start waves manually.\n\n- \nAudio: Balanced volume and added new button SFX.\n\nFixes & Improvements\n\n- \nBombs: Now properly damage enemies (not just you!).\n\n- \nMenus: Fixed mouse disappearing/getting stuck.\n\n- \nVisuals: Refined lighting and color grading.\n\nupdated pricing using Steam’s new Purchasing Power conversion to ensure the game is accessible to more players. Prices reduced by 20% or more in many regions.Example: Our EU price has been lowered from €4,99 to €3,55.\n\nThanks for playing!",
   "matched": [
    "I28"
   ],
   "checked": true,
   "partly": [
    "I26"
   ]
  },
  {
   "gid": "684140727200907388",
   "name": "Update 1.01",
   "version": "1.01",
   "time": 1790805660,
   "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2807130/view/684140727200907388",
   "notes": "- \nNow in 28 languages, including Japanese, Korean and Chinese. The game follows your Steam language, or pick one in Options\n\n- \nNow playable on Linux\n\n- \nNew lighting in every world: an overcast forest, freezing snow, warm lava, a torchlit hub and a glowing furnace\n\n- \nNew title logo, with its own version in Japanese, Korean and Chinese\n\n- \nThe whole Options menu now works with a controller: LB/RB switch tabs and B goes back, great on Steam Deck\n\n- \nController: hold LT to aim, which is when aim assist kicks in. Sprint is now on L3, crouch on R3 and bomb on View\n\n- \nFive achievements that could not be unlocked before now unlock\n\n- \nSmoother play: no freeze on the first hit, and much steadier frame rates on Mac\n\n- \nCoin, heart and bomb icons now look the same on every system\n\n- \nNew 16:10 resolutions, including Steam Deck's 1280x800\n\n- \nFixed: the 2560x1440 option set 2560x1080, rebinding a key removed its controller button, and the pause menu was empty after pressing Esc in Options\n\n- \nFixed: the lava world's last wave played the wrong music, and the snow music restarted off the beat",
   "matched": [],
   "checked": true,
   "partly": []
  },
  {
   "gid": "684140727200908131",
   "name": "Update 1.02",
   "version": "1.02",
   "time": 1790891760,
   "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2807130/view/684140727200908131",
