  {
   "gid": "684140727200909099",
   "name": "Update 2.1",
   "version": "2.1",
   "launch": false,
   "time": 1791073260,
   "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2807130/view/684140727200909099",
   "notes": "A smaller update with two things controller and Steam Deck players will notice right away.\n\nImprovements\n\n- \nAim assist reworked: on controller, shots near a goblin now go to it, at the height you aimed (headshots still count) and leading its movement. Your camera is never moved\n\n- \nMuch smaller game: the download is about a third smaller (about 198 MB instead of 305 MB) and it takes nearly half the storage (about 306 MB instead of 539 MB), great on a Steam Deck\n\nFound a bug or have an idea? Tell us in the Steam discussions.\n\n— Danny",
   "matched": [],
   "checked": true,
   "partly": []
  }
 ],
